# Where AGP drops the signed bundle and its mapping file after a release build. CI keeps these
# as a workflow artifact instead (see docs/release-to-play.md); locally they are ~80 MB of output.
androidApp/release/

# Compose Preview Screenshot Testing's reference images. Not committed yet: Layoutlib's output
